---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Support — WaveCheck"
  description="Get help with your WaveCheck account, subscriptions, and content reports."
  ogType="website"
  ogTitle="WaveCheck Support"
  ogDescription="Get help with your WaveCheck account, subscriptions, and content reports."
  theme="light"
  bodyClass="bg-white text-primary-900 min-h-screen flex flex-col"
>
  <main class="flex-1">
    <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-primary-50 to-white">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-12 pb-8 sm:pt-16 sm:pb-10 text-center">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-premium-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Support</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">How can we help?</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-primary-600 leading-relaxed">Most answers are below. If you can't find what you need, reach out and we'll get back to you.</p>

        <a href="mailto:support@wavecheck.app" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mt-8 px-6 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-primary-900 text-white font-semibold hover:bg-primary-800 transition">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
          support@wavecheck.app
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-8 pb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-8">Frequently asked questions</h2>

      <div class="divide-y divide-primary-100 border border-primary-100 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white">
        <details class="group">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-6 cursor-pointer hover:bg-primary-50">
            <span class="font-semibold">How do I delete my account?</span>
            <svg class="chev w-5 h-5 text-primary-400 transition" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-sm text-primary-600 leading-relaxed">
            Open WaveCheck, go to <strong>Settings &rsaquo; Delete Account</strong>, and confirm. Your profile, posts, likes, follows, and rewards data will be permanently removed. <a href="/delete-account" class="text-premium-600 hover:underline font-medium">Full instructions &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-6 cursor-pointer hover:bg-primary-50">
            <span class="font-semibold">How do I cancel my Premium subscription?</span>
            <svg class="chev w-5 h-5 text-primary-400 transition" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-sm text-primary-600 leading-relaxed space-y-3">
            <p>Subscriptions are billed by Apple or Google, so you'll cancel through the store you subscribed with:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
              <li><strong>iPhone:</strong> Settings &rsaquo; tap your name &rsaquo; Subscriptions &rsaquo; WaveCheck &rsaquo; Cancel.</li>
              <li><strong>Android:</strong> Google Play app &rsaquo; profile &rsaquo; Payments &amp; subscriptions &rsaquo; Subscriptions &rsaquo; WaveCheck &rsaquo; Cancel.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>You'll keep Premium until the end of the current billing period.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-6 cursor-pointer hover:bg-primary-50">
            <span class="font-semibold">How do I report a post or user?</span>
            <svg class="chev w-5 h-5 text-primary-400 transition" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-sm text-primary-600 leading-relaxed">
            Open the post and tap the menu (&hellip;) &rsaquo; <strong>Report</strong>. Pick the reason that best fits. Posts that pass our report threshold are hidden automatically while we review them. Submitting fake reports to take down legitimate posts is against our terms and may cost you points.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-6 cursor-pointer hover:bg-primary-50">
            <span class="font-semibold">Why was my post hidden or removed?</span>
            <svg class="chev w-5 h-5 text-primary-400 transition" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-sm text-primary-600 leading-relaxed">
            WaveCheck is a surf-only platform. Every uploaded photo and video is scanned for non-surf, NSFW, or unsafe content before publishing. Posts can also be hidden after multiple community reports. If you think it was hidden in error, email us with the post link.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-6 cursor-pointer hover:bg-primary-50">
            <span class="font-semibold">I forgot my password.</span>
            <svg class="chev w-5 h-5 text-primary-400 transition" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-sm text-primary-600 leading-relaxed">
            On the sign-in screen tap <strong>Forgot password?</strong> and enter your email. We'll send you a link to set a new one. Check your spam folder if it doesn't show up within a few minutes.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="group">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-6 cursor-pointer hover:bg-primary-50">
            <span class="font-semibold">My local spot isn't listed.</span>
            <svg class="chev w-5 h-5 text-primary-400 transition" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-sm text-primary-600 leading-relaxed">
            Email <a href="mailto:support@wavecheck.app" class="text-premium-600 hover:underline">support@wavecheck.app</a> with the spot name, region, and a rough location. We add new breaks regularly.
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pb-14">
      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-primary-900 text-white p-8 sm:p-10 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Still need help?</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-primary-300 leading-relaxed">We read every message. Include your username and a description of the issue, and we'll get back to you.</p>
        <a href="mailto:support@wavecheck.app" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mt-6 px-6 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-white text-primary-900 font-semibold hover:bg-primary-100 transition">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
          support@wavecheck.app
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
